WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:03.367
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:05.434
You know, I just want
to mention our partner

00:00:05.434 --> 00:00:06.934
Ford has a new truck out,

00:00:06.934 --> 00:00:12.400
the 2024 F-150 PowerBoost Hybrid
with Pro Power Onboard.

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:13.601
This thing is great.

00:00:13.601 --> 00:00:15.000
You can use it to
power things up.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:17.634
It's basically like
a mobile power source.

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:18.734
Anyway, it reminded me
of something

00:00:18.734 --> 00:00:20.067
that happened to me
the other day.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:22.567
The Roots and I were out
together, and we just...

00:00:22.567 --> 00:00:24.734
♪♪

00:00:27.634 --> 00:00:29.634
[ Laughter,
indistinct conversations ]

00:00:37.133 --> 00:00:38.367
This is it, guys,

00:00:38.367 --> 00:00:40.100
"The Tonight Show"
Winter Wonderland.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.901
Soon, the whole neighborhood's
gonna be here.

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:43.467
This is going to be
the best one yet.

00:00:43.467 --> 00:00:45.033
[ Laughter ]

00:00:45.033 --> 00:00:46.634
-Yeah, man, I can't wait
to bite the heads

00:00:46.634 --> 00:00:48.133
off of gingy-bread men.

00:00:48.133 --> 00:00:49.601
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.601 --> 00:00:52.501
-I can't wait to kiss myself
under the mistletoe.

00:00:52.501 --> 00:00:54.000
-Oh!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.567
-I can't wait to munch
on some tree corn.

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:58.567
-And decorate the tree
with oranges.

00:00:58.567 --> 00:01:00.133
-Oh, that's beautiful.

00:01:00.133 --> 00:01:01.868
[ Laughter ]

00:01:01.868 --> 00:01:04.567
-I can't wait to do
my spoken-word poetry.

00:01:04.567 --> 00:01:05.968
Snow.
[ Jazz music playing ]

00:01:05.968 --> 00:01:08.033
Snow falling.

00:01:08.033 --> 00:01:09.734
Falling down.

00:01:09.734 --> 00:01:11.567
Down to the, to the ground.

00:01:11.567 --> 00:01:19.267
Now I hear all the sights and,
and see all the sounds.

00:01:19.267 --> 00:01:25.400
And last night, I blacked out
and hooked up with a clown.

00:01:26.868 --> 00:01:28.934
-Thanks, Tariq.
-Oh, yeah.

00:01:28.934 --> 00:01:30.434
-Hey, Damon, I dare you to stick
your tongue to your tuba.

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:31.667
-Yeah.

00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:34.234
-No, it's freezing out.
My tongue would stick.

00:01:34.234 --> 00:01:38.067
-I double dog dare you.
-Ooh!

00:01:38.067 --> 00:01:42.801
-I triple dog dare you...dawg.
-Ooh!

00:01:45.300 --> 00:01:47.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:57.601
-This is the best party ever!
Nothing could go wrong.

00:01:57.601 --> 00:01:58.734
[ Laughter ]

00:01:58.734 --> 00:02:00.133
-We interrupt this broadcast
with reports

00:02:00.133 --> 00:02:02.534
of widespread power outages
in the neighborh...

00:02:02.534 --> 00:02:03.667
-Power outages?

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:07.434
[ Buzzing ]

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:09.934
[ Hissing ]

00:02:09.934 --> 00:02:11.801
[ Squeaks ]

00:02:11.801 --> 00:02:15.701
-Oh, no! This is a disaster.
What are we going to do?

00:02:15.701 --> 00:02:17.968
-I have an idea.
[ Squish ]

00:02:17.968 --> 00:02:19.701
That didn't work.

00:02:19.701 --> 00:02:22.400
-Think, think.
[ Bells jingling ]

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:28.267
♪♪

00:02:28.267 --> 00:02:30.934
I have an idea.

00:02:39.167 --> 00:02:40.634
Excuse me, sir.

00:02:40.634 --> 00:02:43.434
I couldn't help but notice you
drive a Ford F-150 PowerBoost.

00:02:43.434 --> 00:02:46.300
-Oh-ho-ho!
That's right, little boy.

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.267
And it's got
a full hybrid engine.

00:02:48.267 --> 00:02:50.000
-Yeah, well,
I was wondering if maybe

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:51.234
we could use your truck to --

00:02:51.234 --> 00:02:53.100
-Power up your party,
little boy?

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.300
-Yes. You don't have
to keep calling me --

00:02:55.300 --> 00:02:58.200
-[ Laughs ]
Well, I was on my way

00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:02.367
to deliver some packages,
but, sure, I can help you out.

00:03:02.367 --> 00:03:03.367
-Great!

00:03:03.367 --> 00:03:06.634
♪♪

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:08.534
[ Squish ]

00:03:08.534 --> 00:03:11.434
-Time to bring this
winter wonderland back to life.

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:14.267
♪♪

00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.534
[ Laughs ]

00:03:25.534 --> 00:03:26.767
[ Children shouting ]

00:03:26.767 --> 00:03:28.267
♪♪

00:03:32.534 --> 00:03:35.234
[ All cheering ]

00:03:42.501 --> 00:03:49.634
-Now I hear all the sights
and see all the sounds.

00:03:49.634 --> 00:03:52.234
-What?
-What?

00:03:53.467 --> 00:03:56.367
-Hey, thank you so much.

00:03:56.367 --> 00:04:03.601
This year, you and Ford F-150
PowerBoost saved Christmas.

00:04:03.601 --> 00:04:06.067
By the way,
I never got your na...

00:04:06.067 --> 00:04:08.734
name.

00:04:08.734 --> 00:04:11.601
Wait. Where did he go?

00:04:11.601 --> 00:04:14.400
-Uh, guys, look up there.

00:04:14.400 --> 00:04:16.467
[ Bells jingling,
all cheering ]

00:04:18.367 --> 00:04:22.067
-[ Laughs ]
Merry Christmas!

00:04:22.067 --> 00:04:25.000
-Thank you...Santa.

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.234
[ Creaking ]

00:04:30.234 --> 00:04:31.534
[ All groan ]

00:04:31.534 --> 00:04:33.067
-Happy holidays from

00:04:33.067 --> 00:04:35.067
your friends at Ford
and "The Tonight Show."

00:04:35.067 --> 00:04:36.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:36.334 --> 00:04:41.701
-Yeah! Thank you to
the Ford Motor Company Fund,

00:04:41.701 --> 00:04:43.701
who are donating
all of those toys

00:04:43.701 --> 00:04:45.701
to The Children's Center
in Detroit,

00:04:45.701 --> 00:04:48.100
which provides support
and care for nearly

00:04:48.100 --> 00:04:50.400
3,500 children annually.

00:04:50.400 --> 00:04:51.734
Happy holidays, everyone!

00:04:51.734 --> 00:04:53.300
We'll be right back
with more "Tonight Show."

